script = ExtResource("1_d42dn")
messageID = 13
title = "For Steve Brian"
message = "Bro if you see this you gotta bring all those cans you found.  

The company that owns this mines forgot to turn off their AI operated digging machine before they got shut down and it has been just going at it for weeks! 

With the cans you can melt it, mold it to a large surface area and poke holes into it so it catches all the ore and drains the water. Were gonna be filthy rich!

Also reply to me where you live at, radio tower has not been working for a while now, I don't know when they're gonna fix it

Your pal,
Alex

[NEW Building: Pan]"
